       6→
       7→## Context
       8→
       9→**Inherits from v2/v3**:
      10→- v2: Original architecture - Go + termbox-go, ASCII borders, 20x20 grid
      11→- v3: Code review fixes - data race (mutex/waitgroup), rand.Seed moved to reset()
